{"availability":"available","full":"arash12javadi/react-wp","name":"react-wp","description":"A React-based WordPress alternative that replaces the traditional PHP approach with a modern React architecture, including essential CMS tools and configurations.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-07T11:10:56Z","updated":"2026-10-08T15:46:15Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://react-wp-psi.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://react-wp-psi.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:47.196Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:47.196Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:47.196Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:47.196Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A lightweight, modular, WordPress-style CMS built on React 19, Vite and Supabase.","Familiar to WordPress users (Setup Wizard, roles, plugins, themes, page builder, media library), but a single-page app on top of Postgres instead of a monolith on top of PHP.","Key Features · Architecture · Deployment · Quick Start · Security · Reference"],"features":["Each plugin that owns tables ships schema.sql (run on activation) and uninstall.sql (run only when an administrator explicitly wipes its data). A site that never enables the shop never gets its shop tables.","Floating launcher on every public page (afterfooter slot), plus [rwpchatbox] to place","it on specific pages and [rwpinlinechat] for a whole conversation embedded in a page — both also exist as Page Builder widgets.","AI assistant powered by Google Gemini, answering from the site's own published pages and,","on a product page, the product's real title/price/stock. It never invents a price, a policy, or a delivery promise, and never asks for payment details."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/arash12javadi/react-wp/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0f73ffd0448a6b980f95f59f2127f5db9684834a1e3101bef59b